@startuml
' State diagram for one Exchange (Task 3, Chapter 5, the extra diagram).
' Build:  plantuml -tpng -charset UTF-8 figures/state-exchange.puml
' The return edge from Finished to Re-running is what makes an exchange
' re-runnable rather than a record that can only be read.

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #622423
skinparam StateBorderColor #622423
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FBFAF9
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 44

[*] --> Asked : UC-1 starts

state Asked : the question has been typed,\nbut not yet interpreted

Asked --> Interpreted : interpret() succeeds
Asked --> Rejected : interpret() fails
Rejected --> Asked : the analyst rephrases
Rejected --> [*] : the analyst gives up

Interpreted --> Retrieved : a matching subset is selected
Retrieved --> Drawn : a chart kind is chosen and rendered
Drawn --> Summarised : a summary is produced
Summarised --> Finished : record() writes the exchange

Finished --> Rerunning : rerun() is called
Rerunning --> Finished : reproduceFigure() returns
Finished --> [*] : the record is discarded

@enduml
